# pyproject.toml and uv.lock are deliberately NOT ignored. Dockerfile.lambda
# and Dockerfile both `COPY pyproject.toml uv.lock ./`, so a CI checkout that
# lacks them fails at build time — and an uncommitted lockfile means CI cannot
# reproduce the dependency set the image was tested with.
